    "body": "fix on issue/2561-tab-bridge-all-cuts · PR #2705 · pinned by a_tab_that_a_u_turn_of_its_ring_cuts_into_holds_the_loop, a_tab_that_a_second_ring_cuts_into_holds_the_loop, a_tab_beside_a_narrow_strip_is_named, a_tab_that_grows_over_a_picked_start_says_so, every_tabbed_level_keeps_the_tab_width, the_bridge_holds_on_the_true_arcs_to_a_tenth_of_a_micron · merges when reviewed\n\nThe smaller points:\n\n- `SLACK`: not changed. A test pins the bridge on the true arcs to `1e-4` mm. The PR body and `docs/decisions/2561-tab-bridge-all-cuts.md` give the reason.\n- Picked start: a `tabs:` note names the pick and the new start.\n- More than one tabbed level: a test with three tabbed levels.\n",
