    "body": "The maintainer ordered a takeover of the review fixes on PR #2705. The main session relayed the order at 2026-11-19 about 07:50 UTC.\n\nAn `issue-worker-high` agent of the owner account fixes the two findings of the review of 06:46 UTC on the PR branch `mkinney:issue/2561-tab-bridge-all-cuts`:\n1. `tab_clear.rs` `departed`: the U-turn that comes back to the tab before `off` reaches `need`.\n2. `fit_loops`: compare only the loops that share a tabbed level.\n\nThe agent pushes plain commits to the branch. It does not rebase and does not force-push. @mkinney: please do not push to this branch until the agent comments that its push is done.\n",
